                  "@type": "Answer",
                  "text": "Most Dubai websites fail to generate leads because of slow mobile load times exceeding 3 seconds, heavy WordPress theme builder bloat, lack of localized UAE schema markup (geo.region, ICBM), or missing direct WhatsApp conversion anchors."
