                "@type": "Question",
                "name": "Should I build my website with WordPress or clean Astro code in 2026?",
                "acceptedAnswer": {
                  "@type": "Answer",
                  "text": "Astro static site architecture outperforms WordPress theme builders by 300% in load speed, achieving perfect 100/100 Google Lighthouse scores. Astro eliminates plugin security risks, removes DOM bloat, and provides instant mobile navigation."
